    "body": "Got it!\r\n\r\nI'm not sure we'd want to add this to CustomStateSet, since CustomStateSet is meant to emulate the behavior of native elements / pseudo-classes, and native elements have the same behavior: https://jsbin.com/tuhabikoca/edit?html,css,js,output",
