    "created_at": "2024-09-24T13:02:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-09-24T13:02:36Z",
    "body": "I think part of the fundamental problem with these frameworks is that they maintain state outside of the node tree, ultimately reducing user agency. It seems warranted to investigate how we can better support the programming paradigm while maintaining user agency. It's very popular after all, but doing that seems quite complex.",
